/T1_1 24 Tf
0.45 0 0 0.45 72 419.4 Tm
(strongly inconsistent with a standard Hebbian learning mechanism. We dis\cuss below how a relatively )Tj
ET
BT
/T1_1 24 Tf
0.45 0 0 0.45 72 405.9 Tm
(simple competitive binding dynamic between two chemical pathways that ha\ve opposite effects on the sign )Tj
